            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Questions from patients about analgesic pharmacotherapy and responses from authors are presented to help educate patients and make them more effective self-advocates. The topic addressed in this query is ziconotide, a novel approach to the management of severe and chronic pain prepared from snail venom, its uses and possible side effects.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
